[{"id":350,"name":"Learning.LinearBandit.integral_simpleRegret_le_of_measureReal_le","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"Maiti2026Power.LeanMachineLearning.TwoPoint","package":"Maiti2026Power","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"d982122723756502","local":"10e15ffcea77c334","content":"385deb885004a3eb"},"doc":"**From a PAC guarantee to an expected regret bound** (blueprint\n`lem:fail_prob_from_expected_value`): if the recommendation is `ε`-optimal with probability at\nleast `1 - δ` and the simple regret on the instance `θ` is between `0` and `Z ≥ ε`, then the\nexpected simple regret is at most `ε + (Z - ε) δ`. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"name":"E","role":"type","type":"Type u_1"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedAddCommGroup E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"InnerProductSpace ℝ E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"OpensMeasurableSpace E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"𝒳","role":"variable","type":"Set E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"θ","role":"variable","type":"E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_3"},{"explicit":false,"name":"mΩ","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"P","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure P"},{"explicit":false,"name":"ε","role":"variable","type":"ℝ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"δ","role":"variable","type":"ℝ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Z","role":"variable","type":"ℝ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"out","role":"variable","type":"Ω → ↑𝒳"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hout","role":"hypothesis","type":"Measurable out"},{"explicit":true,"name":"h0","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ x ∈ 𝒳, 0 ≤ simpleRegret 𝒳 θ x"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hZ","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ x ∈ 𝒳, simpleRegret 𝒳 θ x ≤ Z"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hεZ","role":"hypothesis","type":"ε ≤ Z"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hpac","role":"hypothesis","type":"1 - δ ≤ P.real {ω | simpleRegret 𝒳 θ ↑(out ω) ≤ ε}"}],"conclusion":"∫ (ω : Ω), simpleRegret 𝒳 θ ↑(out ω) ∂P ≤ ε + (Z - ε) * δ","decl":"Learning.LinearBandit.integral_simpleRegret_le_of_measureReal_le"},"code":"/-- **From a PAC guarantee to an expected regret bound** (blueprint\n`lem:fail_prob_from_expected_value`): if the recommendation is `ε`-optimal with probability at\nleast `1 - δ` and the simple regret on the instance `θ` is between `0` and `Z ≥ ε`, then the\nexpected simple regret is at most `ε + (Z - ε) δ`. -/\nlemma integral_simpleRegret_le_of_measureReal_le {out : Ω → 𝒳} (hout : Measurable out)\n    (h0 : ∀ x ∈ 𝒳, 0 ≤ simpleRegret 𝒳 θ x) (hZ : ∀ x ∈ 𝒳, simpleRegret 𝒳 θ x ≤ Z)\n    (hεZ : ε ≤ Z) (hpac : 1 - δ ≤ P.real {ω | simpleRegret 𝒳 θ (out ω) ≤ ε}) :\n    ∫ ω, simpleRegret 𝒳 θ (out ω) ∂P ≤ ε + (Z - ε) * δ","proof":":= by\n  have hmeas : Measurable fun ω ↦ simpleRegret 𝒳 θ (out ω) :=\n    ((continuous_const.sub (continuous_subtype_val.inner continuous_const)).measurable).comp hout\n  set G : Set Ω := {ω | simpleRegret 𝒳 θ (out ω) ≤ ε} with hG\n  have hGm : MeasurableSet G := measurableSet_le hmeas measurable_const\n  have hint : Integrable (fun ω ↦ simpleRegret 𝒳 θ (out ω)) P :=\n    Integrable.of_bound hmeas.aestronglyMeasurable |Z|\n      (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun ω ↦ by\n        rw [Real.norm_of_nonneg (h0 _ (out ω).2)]\n        exact (hZ _ (out ω).2).trans (le_abs_self Z))\n  have hind : Integrable (Gᶜ.indicator fun _ ↦ (Z - ε)) P :=\n    (integrable_const (Z - ε)).indicator hGm.compl\n  have hbound : (fun ω ↦ simpleRegret 𝒳 θ (out ω)) ≤\n      fun ω ↦ ε + Gᶜ.indicator (fun _ ↦ (Z - ε)) ω := by\n    intro ω\n    change simpleRegret 𝒳 θ (out ω) ≤ ε + Gᶜ.indicator (fun _ ↦ (Z - ε)) ω\n    by_cases hω : ω ∈ G\n    · rw [Set.indicator_of_notMem (by simpa using hω)]\n      have hε : simpleRegret 𝒳 θ (out ω) ≤ ε := hω\n      linarith\n    · rw [Set.indicator_of_mem hω]\n      have := hZ _ (out ω).2\n      linarith\n  have hδ : P.real Gᶜ ≤ δ := by\n    rw [measureReal_compl hGm, probReal_univ]\n    linarith\n  calc ∫ ω, simpleRegret 𝒳 θ (out ω) ∂P\n      ≤ ∫ ω, ε + Gᶜ.indicator (fun _ ↦ (Z - ε)) ω ∂P :=\n        integral_mono hint ((integrable_const ε).add hind) hbound\n    _ = ε + P.real Gᶜ * (Z - ε) := by\n        rw [integral_add (integrable_const ε) hind, integral_const,\n          integral_indicator_const _ hGm.compl]\n        simp [measureReal_def]\n    _ ≤ ε + (Z - ε) * δ := by\n        have : 0 ≤ Z - ε := by linarith\n        nlinarith","source":{"path":"Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/TwoPoint.lean","start":137,"end":179,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/colt-2026-83/blob/3f6c0f296a3b7e4aa8fe333225505f5b2f61f9e0/Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/TwoPoint.lean#L137-L179"},"deps":[101],"outside":[],"external":[["HAdd.hAdd","lean4","definition"],["HMul.hMul","lean4","definition"],["HSub.hSub","lean4","definition"],["Inner.inner","mathlib","definition"],["InnerProductSpace","mathlib","class"],["InnerProductSpace.toInner","mathlib","instance"],["InnerProductSpace.toNormedSpace","mathlib","instance"],["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["Measurable","mathlib","definition"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.Measure","mathlib","structure"],["MeasureTheory.Measure.real","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.integral","mathlib","definition"],["Membership.mem","lean4","definition"],["NormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","class"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["OfNat.ofNat","lean4","definition"],["One.toOfNat1","lean4","instance"],["OpensMeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","mathlib","instance"],["RCLike.toInnerProductSpaceReal","mathlib","instance"],["Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.instAdd","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instMul","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instOne","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instRCLike","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instSub","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instSupSet","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instZero","mathlib","instance"],["Real.normedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedAddCommGroup.toPseudoMetricSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Set","mathlib","definition"],["Set.Elem","mathlib","definition"],["Set.instMembership","mathlib","instance"],["Set.ofPred","mathlib","definition"],["Subtype.instMeasurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Subtype.val","lean4","definition"],["UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Zero.toOfNat0","lean4","instance"],["iSup","mathlib","definition"],["instHAdd","lean4","instance"],["instHMul","lean4","instance"],["instHSub","lean4","instance"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":null,"specifies":[],"specifiedBy":[],"characterizations":[],"pulled":false,"provenance":null,"edited":{"commit":"f1a92e33571fde49fce6355928bb1a73476e5a39","date":"2026-09-13"}},{"id":351,"name":"Learning.LinearBandit.IsRun.one_sub_le_measureReal_add_of_sq_le","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"Maiti2026Power.LeanMachineLearning.TwoPoint","package":"Maiti2026Power","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"5084ef4d6b834717","local":"90c715de17f03e18","content":"4efeb1cacbf3dfc1"},"doc":"**Three-point inequality** (blueprint `lem:log_gains_three_point`): if the two reward vectors\n`θp` and `θm` both satisfy `⟪x, θ - θp⟫ ^ 2 ≤ C`, resp. `⟪x, θ - θm⟫ ^ 2 ≤ C`, on the action set,\nthen no test on the output of a fixed-budget algorithm with budget `T` separates them:\n`Prob_{θp}(out ∈ B) + Prob_{θm}(out ∉ B) ≥ 1 - 2 √(T C / 4)`. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"name":"E","role":"type","type":"Type u_1"},{"explicit":false,"name":"𝓓","role":"type","type":"Type u_2"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedAddCommGroup E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"InnerProductSpace ℝ E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"OpensMeasurableSpace E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"m𝓓","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"𝒳","role":"variable","type":"Set E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"θ","role":"variable","type":"E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"A","role":"variable","type":"IdentAlg Unit ↑𝒳 ℝ 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"T","role":"variable","type":"ℕ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_3"},{"explicit":false,"name":"mΩ","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"P","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure P"},{"explicit":false,"name":"O","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → Unit"},{"explicit":false,"name":"X","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → ↑𝒳"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Y","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → ℝ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"out","role":"variable","type":"Ω → 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"C","role":"variable","type":"ℝ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"θp","role":"variable","type":"E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"θm","role":"variable","type":"E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Ωp","role":"type","type":"Type u_5"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Ωm","role":"type","type":"Type u_6"},{"explicit":false,"name":"mΩp","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ωp"},{"explicit":false,"name":"mΩm","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ωm"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Pp","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ωp"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Pm","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ωm"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure Pp"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure Pm"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Op","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ωp → Unit"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Xp","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ωp → ↑𝒳"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Yp","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ωp → ℝ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"outp","role":"variable","type":"Ωp → 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Om","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ωm → Unit"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Xm","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ωm → ↑𝒳"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Ym","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ωm → ℝ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"outm","role":"variable","type":"Ωm → 𝓓"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hCp","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ x ∈ 𝒳, inner ℝ x (θ - θp) ^ 2 ≤ C"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hCm","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ x ∈ 𝒳, inner ℝ x (θ - θm) ^ 2 ≤ C"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hA","role":"hypothesis","type":"A.IsFixedBudget T"},{"explicit":true,"name":"h","role":"hypothesis","type":"A.IsRun (linearGaussianEnv 𝒳 θ) O X Y out P"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hp","role":"hypothesis","type":"A.IsRun (linearGaussianEnv 𝒳 θp) Op Xp Yp outp Pp"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hm","role":"hypothesis","type":"A.IsRun (linearGaussianEnv 𝒳 θm) Om Xm Ym outm Pm"},{"explicit":false,"name":"B","role":"variable","type":"Set 𝓓"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hB","role":"hypothesis","type":"MeasurableSet B"}],"conclusion":"1 - 2 * √(↑T * C / 4) ≤ Pp.real (outp ⁻¹' B) + Pm.real (outm ⁻¹' Bᶜ)","decl":"Learning.LinearBandit.IsRun.one_sub_le_measureReal_add_of_sq_le"},"code":"/-- **Three-point inequality** (blueprint `lem:log_gains_three_point`): if the two reward vectors\n`θp` and `θm` both satisfy `⟪x, θ - θp⟫ ^ 2 ≤ C`, resp. `⟪x, θ - θm⟫ ^ 2 ≤ C`, on the action set,\nthen no test on the output of a fixed-budget algorithm with budget `T` separates them:\n`Prob_{θp}(out ∈ B) + Prob_{θm}(out ∉ B) ≥ 1 - 2 √(T C / 4)`. -/\nlemma IsRun.one_sub_le_measureReal_add_of_sq_le {C : ℝ} {θp θm : E}\n    {Ωp Ωm : Type*} {mΩp : MeasurableSpace Ωp} {mΩm : MeasurableSpace Ωm}\n    {Pp : Measure Ωp} {Pm : Measure Ωm} [IsProbabilityMeasure Pp] [IsProbabilityMeasure Pm]\n    {Op : ℕ → Ωp → Unit} {Xp : ℕ → Ωp → 𝒳} {Yp : ℕ → Ωp → ℝ} {outp : Ωp → 𝓓}\n    {Om : ℕ → Ωm → Unit} {Xm : ℕ → Ωm → 𝒳} {Ym : ℕ → Ωm → ℝ} {outm : Ωm → 𝓓}\n    (hCp : ∀ x ∈ 𝒳, ⟪x, θ - θp⟫ ^ 2 ≤ C) (hCm : ∀ x ∈ 𝒳, ⟪x, θ - θm⟫ ^ 2 ≤ C)\n    (hA : A.IsFixedBudget T) (h : A.IsRun (linearGaussianEnv 𝒳 θ) O X Y out P)\n    (hp : A.IsRun (linearGaussianEnv 𝒳 θp) Op Xp Yp outp Pp)\n    (hm : A.IsRun (linearGaussianEnv 𝒳 θm) Om Xm Ym outm Pm)\n    {B : Set 𝓓} (hB : MeasurableSet B) :\n    1 - 2 * √(T * C / 4) ≤ Pp.real (outp ⁻¹' B) + Pm.real (outm ⁻¹' Bᶜ)","proof":":= by\n  have hout : AEMeasurable out P := h.hasCondDistrib_output.aemeasurable_snd\n  have hsum : P.real (out ⁻¹' B) + P.real (out ⁻¹' Bᶜ) = 1 := by\n    have : IsProbabilityMeasure (P.map out) := inferInstance\n    rw [← map_measureReal_apply_of_aemeasurable hout hB,\n      ← map_measureReal_apply_of_aemeasurable hout hB.compl]\n    rw [measureReal_compl hB, probReal_univ]\n    ring\n  have h1 := abs_le.1 (IsRun.abs_measureReal_sub_le_of_sq_le hCp hA h hp hB)\n  have h2 := abs_le.1 (IsRun.abs_measureReal_sub_le_of_sq_le hCm hA h hm hB.compl)\n  linarith [h1.2, h2.2]","source":{"path":"Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/TwoPoint.lean","start":109,"end":133,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/colt-2026-83/blob/3f6c0f296a3b7e4aa8fe333225505f5b2f61f9e0/Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/TwoPoint.lean#L109-L133"},"deps":[93,97],"outside":[],"external":[["AddCommGroup.toAddGroup","mathlib","instance"],["AddGroup.toSubNegMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Compl.compl","mathlib","definition"],["DivInvMonoid.toDiv","mathlib","instance"],["Eq","lean4","inductive"],["HAdd.hAdd","lean4","definition"],["HDiv.hDiv","lean4","definition"],["HMul.hMul","lean4","definition"],["HPow.hPow","lean4","definition"],["HSub.hSub","lean4","definition"],["Inner.inner","mathlib","definition"],["InnerProductSpace","mathlib","class"],["InnerProductSpace.toInner","mathlib","instance"],["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["Learning.Environment","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.Hist","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.IdentAlg","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.IsRun","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.stopSet","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.stationaryEnv","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["MeasurableSet","mathlib","definition"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.IsZeroOrProbabilityMeasure.toIsFiniteMeasure","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.Measure","mathlib","structure"],["MeasureTheory.Measure.real","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.instIsZeroOrProbabilityMeasureOfIsProbabilityMeasure","mathlib","instance"],["Membership.mem","lean4","definition"],["Monoid.toNPow","mathlib","instance"],["NNReal","mathlib","definition"],["NNReal.instOne","mathlib","instance"],["NPow.toPow","mathlib","instance"],["Nat","lean4","inductive"],["Nat.cast","lean4","definition"],["Nat.instAtLeastTwoHAddOfNat","mathlib","instance"],["Nat.instNeZeroSucc","lean4","instance"],["NormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","class"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["OfNat.ofNat","lean4","definition"],["One.toOfNat1","lean4","instance"],["OpensMeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["PUnit.instMeasurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["ProbabilityTheory.Kernel","mathlib","structure"],["ProbabilityTheory.Kernel.mk","mathlib","constructor"],["ProbabilityTheory.gaussianReal","mathlib","definition"],["PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.instAdd","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instDivInvMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instMul","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instNatCast","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instOne","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instRCLike","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instSub","mathlib","instance"],["Real.measurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Real.sqrt","mathlib","definition"],["SeminormedAddCommGroup.toPseudoMetricSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Set","mathlib","definition"],["Set.Elem","mathlib","definition"],["Set.instCompl","mathlib","instance"],["Set.instMembership","mathlib","instance"],["Set.ofPred","mathlib","definition"],["Set.preimage","mathlib","definition"],["Sigma","lean4","structure"],["Sigma.fst","lean4","definition"],["SubNegMonoid.toSub","mathlib","instance"],["Subtype.instMeasurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Subtype.val","lean4","definition"],["UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Unit","lean4","definition"],["instHAdd","lean4","instance"],["instHDiv","lean4","instance"],["instHMul","lean4","instance"],["instHPow","lean4","instance"],["instHSub","lean4","instance"],["instOfNatAtLeastTwo","mathlib","instance"],["instOfNatNat","lean4","instance"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":null,"specifies":[],"specifiedBy":[],"characterizations":[],"pulled":false,"provenance":null,"edited":{"commit":"f1a92e33571fde49fce6355928bb1a73476e5a39","date":"2026-09-13"}},{"id":352,"name":"Learning.LinearBandit.IsRun.klDiv_map_out_le_sum_integral","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"Maiti2026Power.LeanMachineLearning.TwoPoint","package":"Maiti2026Power","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"97a3886fa7f2cac9","local":"9be6d1a63bf0d55b","content":"a6a48fde66d48d74"},"doc":"The divergence between the laws of the outputs of two runs of a fixed-budget algorithm with\nbudget `T` in the linear Gaussian environments with reward vectors `θ` and `θ'` is at most the\nexpected sum of the squared gaps along the trajectory of the first run (the *divergence\ndecomposition*, transferred to the outputs by data processing). ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"name":"E","role":"type","type":"Type u_1"},{"explicit":false,"name":"𝓓","role":"type","type":"Type u_2"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedAddCommGroup E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"InnerProductSpace ℝ E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"OpensMeasurableSpace E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"m𝓓","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"𝒳","role":"variable","type":"Set E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"θ","role":"variable","type":"E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"θ'","role":"variable","type":"E"},{"explicit":false,"name":"A","role":"variable","type":"IdentAlg Unit ↑𝒳 ℝ 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"T","role":"variable","type":"ℕ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_3"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Ω'","role":"type","type":"Type u_4"},{"explicit":false,"name":"mΩ","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"mΩ'","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ω'"},{"explicit":false,"name":"P","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"P'","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ω'"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure P"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure P'"},{"explicit":false,"name":"O","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → Unit"},{"explicit":false,"name":"X","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → ↑𝒳"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Y","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → ℝ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"O'","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω' → Unit"},{"explicit":false,"name":"X'","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω' → ↑𝒳"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Y'","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω' → ℝ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"out","role":"variable","type":"Ω → 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"out'","role":"variable","type":"Ω' → 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"C","role":"variable","type":"ℝ"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hC","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ x ∈ 𝒳, inner ℝ x (θ - θ') ^ 2 ≤ C"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hA","role":"hypothesis","type":"A.IsFixedBudget T"},{"explicit":true,"name":"h","role":"hypothesis","type":"A.IsRun (linearGaussianEnv 𝒳 θ) O X Y out P"},{"explicit":true,"name":"h'","role":"hypothesis","type":"A.IsRun (linearGaussianEnv 𝒳 θ') O' X' Y' out' P'"}],"conclusion":"InformationTheory.klDiv (MeasureTheory.Measure.map out P) (MeasureTheory.Measure.map out' P') ≤\n  ENNReal.ofReal (∑ t ∈ Finset.range T, ∫ (ω : Ω), inner ℝ (↑(X t ω)) (θ - θ') ^ 2 / 2 ∂P)","decl":"Learning.LinearBandit.IsRun.klDiv_map_out_le_sum_integral"},"code":"/-- The divergence between the laws of the outputs of two runs of a fixed-budget algorithm with\nbudget `T` in the linear Gaussian environments with reward vectors `θ` and `θ'` is at most the\nexpected sum of the squared gaps along the trajectory of the first run (the *divergence\ndecomposition*, transferred to the outputs by data processing). -/\nlemma IsRun.klDiv_map_out_le_sum_integral {C : ℝ} (hC : ∀ x ∈ 𝒳, ⟪x, θ - θ'⟫ ^ 2 ≤ C)\n    (hA : A.IsFixedBudget T) (h : A.IsRun (linearGaussianEnv 𝒳 θ) O X Y out P)\n    (h' : A.IsRun (linearGaussianEnv 𝒳 θ') O' X' Y' out' P') :\n    klDiv (P.map out) (P'.map out') ≤\n      ENNReal.ofReal (∑ t ∈ Finset.range T, ∫ ω, ⟪(X t ω : E), θ - θ'⟫ ^ 2 / 2 ∂P)","proof":":=\n  (IdentAlg.IsRun.klDiv_map_out_le hA h h').trans\n    (klDiv_map_history_of_sq_le h.isAlgEnvSeq h'.isAlgEnvSeq hC T).le","source":{"path":"Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/TwoPoint.lean","start":49,"end":59,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/colt-2026-83/blob/3f6c0f296a3b7e4aa8fe333225505f5b2f61f9e0/Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/TwoPoint.lean#L49-L59"},"deps":[93,97],"outside":[],"external":[["AddCommGroup.toAddGroup","mathlib","instance"],["AddGroup.toSubNegMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["DivInvMonoid.toDiv","mathlib","instance"],["ENNReal","mathlib","definition"],["ENNReal.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["ENNReal.ofReal","mathlib","definition"],["Eq","lean4","inductive"],["Finset.range",